error BYN3002: arena `arena` does not live as long as `kept`, which borrows it

   2 │     g = s
     │         - `pass` stores `s` into `g` here
     │
  10 │         pass(name, to: out kept)
     │         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ arena `arena` is freed at the end of its block
     │
  help: copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough
